WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.868
- [singing]
What does the fox say?

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.403
[wild singing]

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.504
- [laughs]

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:05.972
That's crazy, right?

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.274
- Come on,
I'm so sick of this video.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.510
[alert tone]

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.711
- What are you--

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.113
- Who is Sasha Club?

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:14.848
And why is she
thinking about you?

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:15.849
- Hey, come on, baby.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:17.150
That's just my colleague.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.485
You know, that's all that is.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.787
- Whatever.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.956
- You really gonna leave
with my family here?

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:28.995
[dramatic synth music]

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.736
[cheers and applause]

